  XL:30 is very possible through the Lust for Power method, i.e. dally
with foocubi.  This combines perfectly with an extended sacrifest
using the Eye of the Aethiopica and the spell of Create Monster.

  Another great source of XL is the VotD: Wraiths.  The DevTeam
greatly lowers the chance of a corpse from wraiths killed in the VotD
and on the Castle level.  So either lead the wraiths through the
doubly pit trapped and twisty path to the downstairs, or lead them up
and across the Castle level.  Luckily, wraiths fly across the
trapdoors and water.  That should give 5-10 XL right there.


  Foocubi will appear both randomly, as a result of Create Monster,
and (sometimes) from same race sacrifice.  (NB: Same race sacrifice is
only safe for chaotics, or those that want to be.)  Foocubi created by
same race sacrifice will not be hostile.  Anger them safely by hitting
with empty hand.  Hostile foocubi will return after teleporting away.
Peaceful foocubi won't.

  #chat to initiate foocubi encounters.
  Spell of teleport away on headachy foocubi.
  Kill foocubi with severe headaches.
  Having 2+ foocubi active really gets the level gains going.
  - Can even toss in a nurse or two.
    - The Eye of the Aethiopica gives Magic Resistance when carried.
    - Wear an amulet of reflection.
    - Engrave Elbereth with Magicbane.
      - Nurses don't fear Elbereth.
      - Fearful foocubi can be #chatted up to initiate encounters.
      - Spell of magic missile or thrown daggers can be used for 
        killing without wielding a weapon.
    - Spell of wizard lock to control access to altar room.
      - I once used skilled+ spell of Detect Monster to see an 
        approaching foocubi.
        - Spell of knock to unlock door to let foocubi in.
        - Spell of wizard lock to slam door in face of following 
          monster.
        - Dally with foocubi while continuing to nurse dance.

  Preparation:
  - Maximize charisma to improve positive results with 
    - blessed potions of gain ability
    - magic trap dancing (dangerous if you're not careful)
    - rings of adornment
    - cornuthaum (for wizards)
  - Maximize Con and Wis to maximize Hp and Pw gains when leveling up.
  - Continue dallying even after reaching XL:30.  Hp and Pw gains will
    continue.


  Human chaotic Wizards who find the portal to Ludios with a few
levels of an altar can win big:
<http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/msg/e6aa43c8c0c89346?hl=en>


  For spell damage, Magic Missile does ([XL/2] +1 )d6 damage per hit
per monster per cast.  At XL:30 that's (15 + 1) * 3.5 = 56 damage per
hit, and at range and on multiple monsters.  Killing three monsters
with one cast at range is easy.  Or bounce it to average 112 damage on
a single monster.   This is why Wizards should be wielding Magicbane
for the curse resistance.



